---
const nav = [
  { href: '#how', label: 'How it works' },
  { href: '#cli', label: 'CLI' },
  { href: '#trust', label: 'Trust model' },
];
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>TIRAI — Specification-first test automation</title>
<meta name="description" content="TIRAI turns specs into canonical test cases and real Playwright/Vitest execution. Zero AI calls in the tool." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #030208;
    --fg: #eef2ff;
    --muted: #8b90b8;
    --accent: #5eead4;
    --violet: #a78bfa;
    --pink: #f472b6;
    --blue: #60a5fa;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    --sans: 'Space Grotesk', -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  ::selection { background: var(--violet); color: #000; }

  /* — layers — */
  #stars, #nebula, #hero3d { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  #stars { z-index: 0; }
  #nebula { z-index: 1; opacity: .55; }
  #hero3d { z-index: 2; opacity: .9; }
  .content { position: relative; z-index: 10; }

  /* — nav — */
  header {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3,2,8,.85), rgba(3,2,8,0));
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; height: 68px; gap: 32px; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
  .logo {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .logo .orb {
    width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: conic-gradient(from 90deg, var(--accent), var(--violet), var(--pink), var(--accent));
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--violet), 0 0 40px rgba(167,139,250,.5);
    animation: spin 6s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  nav .links { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  nav .links a { transition: color .2s; }
  nav .links a:hover { color: var(--fg); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--violet); }
  nav .gh {
    padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--mono);
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.4);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(167,139,250,.12), rgba(94,234,212,.12));
    transition: box-shadow .25s;
  }
  nav .gh:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(167,139,250,.5); }

  /* — hero — */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
    position: relative; padding: 120px 24px 80px;
  }
  .hero-orb {
    width: 340px; height: 340px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(94,234,212,.35)) drop-shadow(0 0 80px rgba(167,139,250,.3));
  }
  /* — status badge: rotating gradient border + ping dot + split segments — */
  .badge-wrap { position: relative; display: inline-flex; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .badge {
    position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--mono);
    background: rgba(10,8,22,.7); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .badge::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -1px; border-radius: 999px; z-index: -1;
    background: conic-gradient(from var(--bangle, 0deg),
      transparent 0%, var(--accent) 12%, var(--violet) 28%, var(--pink) 44%, transparent 60%, transparent 100%);
    animation: badge-spin 4s linear infinite;
  }
  .badge::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 999px; z-index: -1;
    background: rgba(10,8,22,.9);
  }
  @property --bangle { syntax: '<angle>'; inherits: false; initial-value: 0deg; }
  @keyframes badge-spin { to { --bangle: 360deg; } }
  .badge .seg {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    padding: 7px 14px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .badge .seg + .seg { border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .badge .seg.status { color: var(--accent); }
  .badge .seg.ver { color: var(--muted); }
  .ping {
    position: relative; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent), 0 0 20px rgba(94,234,212,.5);
  }
  .ping::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -5px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent); opacity: .7;
    animation: ping-ring 1.8s cubic-bezier(0,0,.2,1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ping-ring {
    0% { transform: scale(.5); opacity: .8; }
    80%,100% { transform: scale(1.9); opacity: 0; }
  }
  /* nav chip */
  .devchip {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .12em;
    padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 2px;
    color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid rgba(94,234,212,.45);
    background: rgba(94,234,212,.08); text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: chip-glow 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes chip-glow {
    0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(94,234,212,.15); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(94,234,212,.45); }
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.02; margin-bottom: 26px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(167,139,250,.35);
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--blue) 45%, var(--violet) 75%, var(--pink) 100%);
    background-size: 220% auto;
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    animation: shimmer 7s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes shimmer { to { background-position: 220% center; } }
  .sub { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 660px; margin: 0 auto 44px; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--blue));
    color: #040b14; box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(94,234,212,.4);
  }
  .btn.primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 60px rgba(94,234,212,.55); }
  .btn.ghost {
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.4); color: var(--fg);
    background: rgba(167,139,250,.08); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .btn.ghost:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(167,139,250,.35); }
  .install-cmd {
    margin-top: 40px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 22px; border-radius: 12px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .install-cmd .prompt { color: var(--accent); }
  .install-cmd .copy {
    margin-left: 8px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); color: var(--fg); cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent; font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .install-cmd .copy:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

  .scroll-hint {
    position: absolute; bottom: 34px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .3em; font-family: var(--mono);
    animation: float 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float { 0%,100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-8px)} }

  /* — strip — */
  .strip {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    padding: 26px 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 56px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .strip .stat { text-align: center; }
  .strip .num {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent), var(--blue));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
  }
  .strip .lbl { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* — sections — */
  section { padding: 130px 0; position: relative; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .22em; color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 56px; }

  /* — orbit pipeline — */
  .orbit-wrap { position: relative; height: 460px; margin: 20px 0 40px; }
  .orbit-stage {
    position: absolute; width: 200px; padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 14px; text-align: center;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .orbit-stage:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(167,139,250,.3); }
  .orbit-stage .num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .orbit-stage .name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .orbit-stage .desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  .orbit-line {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .orbit-wrap { height: auto; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
    .orbit-stage { position: static; width: auto; }
    .orbit-line { display: none; }
  }

  /* — glass cards — */
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .card {
    position: relative; padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.035); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px); overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform .25s, border-color .25s;
    transform-style: preserve-3d; perspective: 800px;
  }
  .card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 30%, rgba(94,234,212,.5), rgba(167,139,250,.5), transparent 70%);
    -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude;
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity .3s; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .card code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .9em; color: var(--accent); }
  .card .ico {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 22px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent), var(--violet));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(94,234,212,.4));
  }

  /* — terminal — */
  .terminal {
    border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13.5px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,15,40,.85), rgba(8,6,18,.92));
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6), 0 0 60px rgba(167,139,250,.12);
  }
  .term-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px;
  }
  .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot.r { background: #ff5f57; } .dot.y { background: #ffbd2e; } .dot.g { background: #28c840; }
  .term-title { margin-left: 10px; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .term-body { padding: 26px 30px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .term-body .ln { display: block; padding: 4px 0; white-space: pre; }
  .cmd { color: var(--fg); }
  .cmd::before { content: '❯ '; color: var(--accent); }
  .out { color: var(--muted); }
  .out .ok { color: var(--accent); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(94,234,212,.5); }
  .cursor {
    display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 15px; background: var(--accent);
    vertical-align: -2px; animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

  /* — trust — */
  .trust-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .trust-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .trust-list { list-style: none; }
  .trust-list li {
    padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateX(24px);
    transition: opacity .5s, transform .5s;
  }
  .trust-list li.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .trust-list .tick {
    color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--mono); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(94,234,212,.6);
  }
  .trust-list strong { display: block; font-size: 15.5px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .trust-list span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

  /* — foot cta — */
  .foot-cta { text-align: center; padding: 140px 24px; position: relative; }
  .foot-cta h2 { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  footer {
    padding: 40px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px;
  }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }

  /* — reveal — */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(36px); transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease; }
  .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="stars"></canvas>
<div id="nebula"></div>
<canvas id="hero3d"></canvas>

<div class="content">

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a class="logo" href="/"><span class="orb"></span>TIRAI<span class="devchip">dev</span></a>
      <div class="links">
        {nav.map(n => <a href={n.href}>{n.label}</a>)}
      </div>
      <a class="gh" href="https://github.com/truongnat/TIRAI">★ GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="badge-wrap">
    <span class="badge">
      <span class="seg status"><span class="ping"></span>IN DEVELOPMENT</span>
      <span class="seg ver">v1.1.0</span>
      <span class="seg ver">MIT</span>
      <span class="seg ver">zero AI calls</span>
    </span>
  </div>
  <h1>Specification-first<br /><em>test automation</em></h1>
  <p class="sub">
    Turn Excel, PDF, DOCX, Markdown, and JSON specs into canonical test cases —
    executed for real on Chromium &amp; Vitest. Deterministic. Inspectable. Fail-closed.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn primary" href="#install">⌁ Install CLI</a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="#how">How it works ↓</a>
  </div>
  <div class="install-cmd">
    <span class="prompt">$</span>
    <span>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/truongnat/TIRAI/main/install.sh | bash</span>
    <button class="copy" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/truongnat/TIRAI/main/install.sh | bash');this.textContent='copied'">copy</button>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL</div>
</div>

<!-- STRIP -->
<div class="strip">
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">0</div><div class="lbl">AI calls at runtime</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">7</div><div class="lbl">source formats</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">22</div><div class="lbl">workspaces</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">143</div><div class="lbl">executor tests</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">3</div><div class="lbl">exit codes</div></div>
</div>

<!-- HOW -->
<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
    <h2>The host agent decides <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)">what</em>.<br />TIRAI decides <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)">how</em>.</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Most test tools start from code. TIRAI starts from specifications.
      The host AI reads your spec, writes canonical JSON artifacts, and TIRAI executes them
      deterministically — no guessing, no silent fallbacks.
    </p>
    <div class="orbit-wrap reveal">
      <svg class="orbit-line" viewBox="0 0 1100 460" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M100,230 C250,60 450,60 550,230 C650,400 850,400 1000,230"
          fill="none" stroke="url(#g1)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/>
        <defs><linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#5eead4"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#a78bfa"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f472b6"/>
        </linearGradient></defs>
      </svg>
      <div class="orbit-stage" style="left:2%;top:38%">
        <div class="num">01 / INGEST</div>
        <div class="name">Multi-source</div>
        <div class="desc">Excel · PDF · DOCX · MD · CSV · JSON · URL → canonical context</div>
      </div>
      <div class="orbit-stage" style="left:23%;top:8%">
        <div class="num">02 / HOST IR</div>
        <div class="name">Semantic artifacts</div>
        <div class="desc">Host agent writes requirements, test-plan, testcases</div>
      </div>
      <div class="orbit-stage" style="left:43%;top:44%">
        <div class="num">03 / IMPORT</div>
        <div class="name">Validated</div>
        <div class="desc">artifact import checks schema — invalid input fails closed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="orbit-stage" style="left:64%;top:70%">
        <div class="num">04 / EXECUTE</div>
        <div class="name">Real runners</div>
        <div class="desc">Chromium + Vitest · secrets via env refs · cleanup required</div>
      </div>
      <div class="orbit-stage" style="left:82%;top:32%">
        <div class="num">05 / REPORT</div>
        <div class="name">Canonical result</div>
        <div class="desc">PASS / FAIL / BLOCKED with sanitized evidence per run</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
    <h2>Everything downstream of the spec<br />is deterministic.</h2>
    <p class="lead">No model calls inside the tool. No credentials stored. No silent guessing.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">⟶</span>
        <h3>Multi-source ingestion</h3>
        <p>Excel, PDF, DOCX, Markdown, CSV, JSON, remote HTML — one canonical pipeline regardless of format.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">◈</span>
        <h3>Canonical JSON artifacts</h3>
        <p>Requirements, plans, cases live as validated JSON in <code>.tirai/artifacts/</code> — truth between spec and execution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">▶</span>
        <h3>Real browser execution</h3>
        <p>Playwright drives actual Chromium. DOM-id and positional locators guaranteed unique; ambiguous targets block.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">⚿</span>
        <h3>Secret refs, not secrets</h3>
        <p><code>secret://env:NAME</code> resolves at runtime through <code>auth</code> refs — credentials never enter artifacts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">✕</span>
        <h3>Fail-closed validation</h3>
        <p>Unconfigured envs, stale specs, ambiguous elements, missing cleanup — exit 2, never a silent pass.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="ico">⎘</span>
        <h3>Multi-format export</h3>
        <p>JSON, Excel, Markdown, PDF, DOCX — export cases without mutating the source of truth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CLI -->
<section id="cli">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">CLI</div>
    <h2>One command surface.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Init → ingest → import → approve → execute → report. Deterministic, inspectable, CI-ready.</p>
    <div class="terminal reveal">
      <div class="term-bar">
        <span class="dot r"></span><span class="dot y"></span><span class="dot g"></span>
        <span class="term-title">tirai — session</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term-body" id="term">
        <span class="ln cmd">tirai init --name my-app</span>
        <span class="ln out">Initialized TIRAI workspace at ./.tirai</span>
        <span class="ln">&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="ln cmd">tirai ingest specs/checkout.md</span>
        <span class="ln out">Ingested: 3 requirements, 7 scenarios</span>
        <span class="ln">&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="ln cmd">tirai artifact import testcases --file testcases.json</span>
